asset:        ne_50m_countries.geojson
title:        World country boundaries, 1:50m (Admin 0 – Countries)
author:       Natural Earth (naturalearthdata.com), Nathaniel Vaughn Kelso et al.
source:       https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector/blob/v5.1.2/geojson/ne_50m_admin_0_countries.geojson
license:      Public domain (Natural Earth terms of use: https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/)
added:        2026-10-13 by MapCraft contributors (Claude agent, map layer spike)
notes:        Properties reduced to name, iso (ISO_A3, falling back to ADM0_A3) and continent; coordinates rounded to 3 decimals. Bundled by crates/geo for the Map layer when zoomed in (zoom 1.5 and closer).
